sequenceDiagram
    Student ->> UMS: authenticateUser(email, password)
    UMS ->> Student: returns session token or user details
    Student ->> ES: enroll(studentId, courseId, academicPeriod)
    ES ->> AMS: checkPrerequisites(studentId, courseId)
    AMS --> ES: returns prerequisite status
    ES ->> SS: checkCapacity(courseId, academicPeriod)
    SS --> ES: returns available slots
    ES ->> EVS: createEnrollmentRecord(studentId, courseId, academicPeriod)
    EVS --> ES: confirms enrollment
    ES ->> SS: updateSchedule(courseId, academicPeriod, scheduleData)
    SS --> ES: confirms schedule update
    ES ->> CS: sendNotification(userId, "Course Enrollment Confirmation")
    CS --> Student: sends notification